                           <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="2.7.0.0"><p style="tab-interval:0.393in;tab-stops:left 1.377in">Dear Sir/Madam,</p><p style="tab-interval:0.393in;tab-stops:left 1.377in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">  </span></p><p style="tab-interval:0.393in;tab-stops:left 1.377in">Since you have not reacted to our previous dunning notices, we have had to calculate interest on arrears to the amount of<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField022666" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/> %.<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">   </span></p><p style="tab-interval:0.393in;tab-stops:left 1.377in">For the items due, as well as for the interest on arrears, we are now giving you a final payment period up until<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField008926" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/> .<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span>If you do not adhere to this payment deadline, we will unfortunately have to apply for a court order for our receivables to the amount of<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField011689" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">    </span><span xfa:embed="#floatingField001892" xfa:embedMode="raw" xfa:embedType="uri"/> .<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">   </span></p></body>
